s can now contain Text-To-Speech snippets!</li>\n <li>[Localization] The TikTok region is now adjustable (relevant for gifts) (see "Setup" => "Advanced Settings")</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to hide profile pictures</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to set profile picture size</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to set username color and font size</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to add font border color</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to change the line height between username and text</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to display username and text in the same line</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New option to display the gift image instead the profile picture</li>\n <li>[Alerts] New username wiggle effect</li>\n <li>[Goals] Coin goal now counts coins correctly (hopefully)</li>\n <li>[Overlays] Line and letter spacing can now be adjusted for all overlays!</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <br>\n <div>\n <b>2022-08-10:</b>\n <ul>\n <li>[Events] An event can now trigger up to 3 actions! (If you use the same screen then the actions will be played one after the other. To start actions at the same time you have to use different screens)</li>\n <li>[Events] An event can now trigger a random action from a definable action list!</li>\n <li>[Events] New trigger user type option "Any Follower"!</li>\n <li>[Actions] You can now activate the option "Repeat with gift streaks" in the actions to repeat the action with the gift multiplier!</li>\n <li>[TikTok] The connection to TikTok can now be established via a browser extension (as an alternative to the server-side connection, see Setup => Advanced Settings)</li>\n <li>[Goals] New Goal to show the earned Channel Points</li>\n <li>[Goals] New Goal for the viewer count</li>\n <li>[Snap Camera] Update to support the latest version</li>\n <li>[OBS Overlays] New Gift Feed Overlay!</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br><br> --\x3e\n\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection startHidden" style="width: 860px;" id="start-faq">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">FAQ</h