\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <div>\n  If the connection to the TikFinity server is unstable and you receive<br>\n  a large number of API errors, you can switch to an alternative server.<br>\n  This creates an entry in your system\'s hosts file.\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div id="buttonSwitchServer"></div>\n  <div id="buttonRestoreServer"></div>\n\n  <br>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-debug-options">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Debug Options</h3>\n\n <table>\n <tr>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <div>\n  This function is used to identify errors.<br>\n  Activate it when prompted by the TikFinity Support Team!\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div id="buttonEnableDebug"></div>\n  <div id="buttonOpenTikTok"></div>\n\n  <br>\n  </td>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <pre id="browserBridgeDebug" style="margin-top: -30px; margin-left: 100px;"></pre>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n\n</div>\n<br><br><br>\n\n<div id="setupConditionalDbResetPopup"></div>'},{name:"chatbot",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading" data-str="chatbot_head"></h2>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div id="notificationChatbotNeedsApproval" class="hidden">\n <div id="chatbotNoticeBanners">\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 900px; background-color: #570d1c;" data-str="chatbot_requirements"></div>\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 900px; background-color: #570d1c;" data-str="chatbot_replacement"></div>\n <br>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id="chatbotWarning">\n <br>\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 650px; background-color: #570d1c;">Please keep in mind that your account is used to send chatbot messages. Make sure that all messages comply with the TikTok rules, because you are responsible for them! If you have problems with the chatbot, take a look at our <a href="/chatbot-troubleshooting" target="_blank">Troubleshooting Guide</a>.</div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div id="checkboxEnableChatbot"></div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection" style="width: 1000px;" id="chatbot-message-log">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Message Log</h3>\n <div id="chatbotMessageLogArea" style="font-size: 0.9em;">\n <i>No Messages Sent</i>\n </div>\n <br>\n\n <div id="chatbotTestButton"></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<br><br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection" style="width: 1000px;" id="chatbot-spam-protection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Spam Protection</h3>\n <div>To prevent TikTok from filtering the messages, you should limit the number of messages sent by the chatbot.</div><br>\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">Maximum number of messages</div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="chatbotMaxMessages15SecondsNumberbox"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection" style="width: 1000px;" id="chatbot-streamerbot-messages">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Streamer.bot Messages</h3>\n <div>\n You can send custom chat messages to your TikTok chat via <a href="https://streamer.bot/" target="_blank">Streamer.bot</a>. This allows you to use triggers from other<br>\n platforms such as Twitch. You also have a wide range of other options. Read the <a href="/streamerbot-integration" target="_blank">Integration Guide</a> for more information.</div><br>\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div id="checkboxEnableStreamerbotMessages"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n <div id="configureStreamerBotButton"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<h3 class="blueheading" id="chatbot-snippet-configuration">Snippet Configuration</h3>\n<div data-str="chatbot_desc"></div><br>\n<div class="dx-viewport">\n <div class="chatbotanswergrid-container">\n <div id="dataGridChatbotAnswers"></div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n\x3c!-- <br>\n<h3 class="blueheading" data-str="chatbot_account"></h3>\n<div data-str="chatbot_account_desc"></div><br>\n\n<div class="redNotification hidden" id="chatbotNotAvailable">\n <div data-str="chatbot_not_available"></div>\n</div>\n<br>\n\n<div id="checkboxUseMyAccount"></div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<br>\n<h3 class="blueheading" data-str="chatbot_ki"></h3>\n<div data-str="chatbot_ki_desc"></div><br>\n\n<div id="checkboxUseKi"></div> --\x3e\n\n<br><br><br>'},{name:"chatcommands",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading" data-str="chatcommands_head"></h2>\n\n<div data-str="chatcommands_desc"></div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection" style="width: 900px" id="chatcommands-commands">\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset">\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdHelpEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_help"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdHelp"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  <div class="helpTextBehindTextBox"><a onclick="utils.openHelpPopup(this)"><i class="far fa-question-circle"></i> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_how_it_works"></span></a></div>\n  <div style="display: none;">\n  <div class="helptitle" data-str="chatcommands_command_help_head"></div>\n  <div class="helptext" data-str="chatcommands_command_help_desc"></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdGetPointsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_score"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdGetPoints"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  <div class="helpTextBehindTextBox"><a onclick="utils.openHelpPopup(this)"><i class="far fa-question-circle"></i> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_how_it_works"></span></a></div>\n  <div style="display: none;">\n  <div class="helptitle" data-str="chatcommands_command_score_head"></div>\n  <div class="helptext" data-str="chatcommands_command_score_desc"></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdTransferPointsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_send"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdTransferPoints"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  <div class="helpTextBehindTextBox"><a onclick="utils.openHelpPopup(this)"><i class="far fa-question-circle"></i> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_how_it_works"></span></a></div>\n  <div style="display: none;">\n  <div class="helptitle" data-str="chatcommands_command_send_head"></div>\n  <div class="helptext" data-str="chatcommands_command_send_desc"></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdSpinEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_spin"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdSpin"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton" data-destpage="wheel"></div>\n  <div class="helpTextBehindTextBox"><a onclick="utils.openHelpPopup(this)"><i class="far fa-question-circle"></i> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_how_it_works"></span></a></div>\n  <div style="display: none;">\n  <div class="helptitle" data-str="chatcommands_command_spin_head"></div>\n  <div class="helptext" data-str="chatcommands_command_spin_desc"></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCoinDropEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_coindrop"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCoinDrop"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton" data-destpage="coindrop"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection" style="width: 900px" id="chatcommands-custom">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader" data-str="chatcommands_custom_head"></h3>\n\n <div data-str="chatcommands_custom_desc"></div>\n\n <br><br>\n\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset largeCommandDescriptionLabels">\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCustomCommandsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_custom_commands"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCustomCommands"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCustomSubCommandsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_custom_sub_commands"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCustomSubCommands"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCustomUserCommandsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_custom_user_commands"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCustomUserCommands"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>'},{name:"tts",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<h2 class="blueheading">Text-to-Speech Chat</h2>\n\n<div class="localeSpecific localeSpecific_en">\n Here you can read out the chat comments from your viewers automatically via Text-to-Speech (TTS).<br>\n The voice is played directly in the browser. No Overlay is required!<br>\n A TTS feature is also available via <a onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'actionsandevents\')">Actions & Events</a> which offers more flexibility. (e.g. Read out gifts)\n</div>\n\n<div class="localeSpecific localeSpecific_de">\n Hier kannst du die Chat-Kommentare deiner Zuschauer automatisch über Text-to-Speech (TTS) vorlesen lassen.<br>\n Die Stimme wird direkt im Browser abgespielt. Es ist kein Overlay erforderlich!<br>\n Eine TTS-Funktion ist auch über <a onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'actionsandevents\')">Aktionen & Events</a> verfügbar, die mehr Flexibilität bietet. (z. B. Geschenke vorlesen)\n</div>\n\n<div class="localeSpecific localeSpecific_es">\n Aquí puedes leer los comentarios del chat de tus espectadores automáticamente mediante Texto a Voz (TTS).<br>\n La voz se reproduce directamente en el navegador. ¡No se requiere ningún overlay!<br>\n También hay una función TTS disponible a través de <a onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'actionsandevents\')">Acciones y Eventos</a> que ofrece más flexibilidad. (por ejemplo, leer regalos)\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div id="ttsOverQuotaBanner" class="redNotification hidden" style="max-width: 1100px; cursor: pointer; background-color: #661525;" onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(`TTS_DAILY_QUOTA`, true)">\n <div>\n <table>\n <tr>\n <td style="font-size: 2em; padding-right: 15px; color: #d43555;">\n  <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>\n </td>\n <td>\n  The professional voices (marked with ⭐ and 🎵) are currently disabled for you because you have reached the daily limit of 100 uses.<br>\n  You can upgrade to <a onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(`TTS_DAILY_QUOTA`, true);">TikFinity Pro</a> for unlimited use of all voices or switch back to the free "default voice".<br>\n  We hope for your understanding because the generation of the voices costs us additional server ressources.\n </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<table id="ttsSettingsTable">\n <tr>\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">General Settings</h4>\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div><b>Enabled</b></div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsEnabled"></div>\n  <div id="ttsStartHint" style="position: absolute; margin-top: -30px; margin-left: 30px; cursor: pointer;" onclick="$(\'#checkboxTtsEnabled\').click()">\n  <div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 1.5em">👈</div>\n  <div style="display: inline-block;"><b>Start here</b></div>\n  </div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Language</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="selectboxTtsLanguage"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Voice <small style="color: #fe2c55; position: absolute; margin-left: 6px;">NEW!</small></div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="selectboxTtsVoice"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr class="proVoiceSelectNote hidden">\n  <td>\n  <div></div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="voiceLimitNotice"><small style="width: 180px;display: block;margin-top: -15px;"></small></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Random Voice</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsRandomVoiceV2"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Default Speed</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsDefaultSpeed"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Default Pitch</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsDefaultPitch"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Volume</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="slideTtsVolume"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Allowed Users</h4>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersNormal"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersFollowers"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersSubscribers"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersModerators"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersTeamMembers"></div><br><div onclick="tts.setMinimumMemberLevel()" style="font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: 5px;margin-left: 38px;color: #359bd4;cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Min. Level: <span id="ttsTeamMembersMinLevel">1</span></div><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersTopGifters"></div><br><div onclick="tts.setTopGiftersN()" style="font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: 5px;margin-left: 38px;color: #359bd4;cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Top: <span id="ttsTopGiftersTopN">3</span></div><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersSpecific"></div><br><div onclick="$(\'#ttsSpecialUserSection\').removeClass(\'shakeEffect\'); setTimeout(() => $(\'#ttsSpecialUserSection\').addClass(\'shakeEffect\'), 100)" style="font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: 5px;margin-left: 38px;color: #359bd4;cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Manage List</div><br>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Comment Types</h4>\n <p>Read...</p>\n <div id="radiogroupTtsCommentTypes"></div>\n <table id="ttsCommentTypesCommandTable">\n  <tr>\n  <td>Command</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="textboxCommentTypesSpecialCommand"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td style="max-width: 330px;">\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Charge Points</h4>\n <div id="radiogroupTtsChargePoints"></div>\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Cost per Message</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsCost"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n\n <div id="ttsChargePointsWarning" style="color: #e97373;">The subtraction of points is only possible if you select the comment type option starting with "dot" or "slash"! Otherwise, viewers would lose points for each comment!</div>\n\n <small>(If the user doesn\'t have enough points, the comment will NOT be read)</small>\n </div>\n </td>\n </tr>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n <tr style="vertical-align: top;">\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" id="ttsSpecialUserSection">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Special Users</h4>\n\n <div>\n  Here you can allow and disallow users to use TTS and assign their own voices!<br>\n  If you disable the "Allowed" option, the user is entirely blocked from TTS.<br>\n  Click on + to add a new user.\n </div>\n\n <br>\n <div id="ttsUserGrid"></div>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td style="padding-left: 30px;">\n <div id="ttsVoiceTesterArea" class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="height: 310px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Voice Tester</h4>\n\n <div id="textboxTtsTest"></div>\n <div id="buttonTtsTest" style="margin-top: -2px;"></div>\n\n <br><br>\n <h4 class="blueheading">TTS Logs</h4>\n <pre id="ttsLogs" style="position: absolute; max-width: 400px;">No Entries</pre>\n </div>\n </td>\n </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n<table>\n <tr>\n <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Spam Protection</h4>\n <table id="ttsSpamProtectionTable">\n  <tr>\n  <td>User Cooldown (seconds)</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsUserCooldown"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>Max Queue Length</td>\n  <td>\n 